WEBVTT

00:09:57.176 --> 00:10:01.722
If languishing is stagnation,
flow involves momentum.

00:10:01.764 --> 00:10:05.017
But mastery does not have to be
a big accomplishment,

00:10:05.059 --> 00:10:07.102
it can be small wins.

00:10:07.102 --> 00:10:10.356
Small wins explain
why I was drawn to online Scrabble

00:10:10.356 --> 00:10:13.525
for the rush of playing
a seven-letter word.

00:10:13.525 --> 00:10:16.362
Small wins makes sense
of why so many people were thrilled

00:10:16.362 --> 00:10:18.947
to bake their first loaf
of sourdough bread.

00:10:18.947 --> 00:10:23.577
And small wins explain
why one engineer spent an entire afternoon

00:10:23.619 --> 00:10:28.374
mastering the art of stacking M&amp;M's
on top of each other.

00:10:28.415 --> 00:10:29.667
Take a look.